  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u21a11889\" id=\"u21a11889\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1703942340355-7f4187e1-fd92-4027-afb6-42f62aa6f32a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u01b26643-3e49-474d-ba11-4126ea0c585%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4d07f260-4932-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A735.4666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A511%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A351778%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1379%2C%22originHeight%22%3A958%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u81156652%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub0961684\" id=\"ub0961684\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a35825d\" id=\"u2a35825d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">单片机（Microcontroller）是一种集成电路芯片，它集成了处理器、存储器、输入/输出接口以及各种功能模块于一身。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubf02b205\" id=\"ubf02b205\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1703577643492-50797ff7-29d7-4b6f-968d-175b2f7acda4.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9b8b333b-9c50-4f82-9ad5-eef719d9d2f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u21592f59-93dc-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A648%2C%22height%22%3A457%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A516751%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1458%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1029%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22